   flagged in COMPONENT_LIBRARY.md §2.6 as DOM-id-coupled to
   `main.js`'s `initFaqGreenGlow()` and still using retired v1 tokens
   (`zunkiree-600`, dark gradient-bloom card) that MASTER_DESIGN_SPEC.md's
   2026-07-26 update retired sitewide. Decoupling that partial is a
   separate architectural fix, out of scope here.

   Not in PAGE_BLUEPRINTS.md §1's homepage section list, but fills a
   real, separately-confirmed gap: CLAUDE.md's AEO requirement ("FAQ
   sections with natural-language questions") and the full-page audit
   that found zero FAQ content anywhere on homepage-v2.

   Content sourced from CONTENT_SUMMARY.md and company-industry-
   context.md only — no fabricated facts. Q1 and Q3 deliberately
   correct the stale "six industries" framing still live elsewhere on
   the site (aboutFaq.json, contact.njk, agentic-as-a-service.njk —
   flagged as a conflict in CONTENT_SUMMARY.md's Summary of Conflicts
   #1) with the accurate four-vertical answer. No pricing question
   included — no public pricing model is confirmed in any doc.
